  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Hei Cheng states the Gu is merely rank six and can shoot out up to three dark arrows at the same time. The first dark arrow he shoots at Fang Yuan is small and black, its body short, about half a person’s arm in length, and it gives off no aura of danger. The attack homes in on enemies, turns in different directions, and is fast enough that Fang Yuan cannot shake it off with light illusion bat wings alone. A dark arrow can pierce the mortal killer move hair armor in one hit and can harm Fang Yuan’s immortal zombie body; in that fight the arrow aims for his brain. Hei Lou Lan’s side already treats the Gu as attack-only, with no capture methods from it.",
        "chapters": [
          677
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Cheng uses the Gu at its limit to fire three dark arrows during that fight. He has not formed an immortal killer move with Dark Arrow as core yet, but he has mortal killer moves that can change the arrows, including fusing two arrows into one. Fairy Li Shan seals dark arrows with prepared mortal killer moves because she cannot face the attack-type Immortal Gu head on.",
        "chapters": [
          689
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "northern-plains-battles",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later still holds Dark Arrow after losing Immortal Gu House Dark Prison. During the hundred days battle, Shadow Sect designs immortal killer moves that use dark arrow Immortal Gu as the core.",
        "chapters": [
          941
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "northern-plains-battles",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_immortal_gu_house",
          "house_dark_prison",
          "fac_shadow_sect"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
